Subject: Ld.ld_so_diagnostics: pass ld.so as a String

exec takes no Pathname (TypeError), so in the fork path the child died and the diagnostics were always empty; in HOMEBREW_SPAWN_SYSTEM mode it raised.
---
--- a/Library/Homebrew/os/linux/ld.rb
+++ b/Library/Homebrew/os/linux/ld.rb
@@ -68,7 +68,7 @@
         end
 
         @ld_so_diagnostics[ld_so_target] ||= begin
-          ld_so_output = Utils.popen_read(ld_so, "--list-diagnostics")
+          ld_so_output = Utils.popen_read(ld_so.to_s, "--list-diagnostics")
           ld_so_output if $CHILD_STATUS.success?
         end
 
